# The official gem5 upstream source tree is vendored under CHAOS/gem5/ as
# ordinary tracked files. These must NOT be committed:
#   - the upstream .git database (large, nested)
#   - build/m5out artifacts (huge; also covered by nested upstream .gitignore)
CHAOS/gem5/.git/
build/
m5out/

# Full-system-sim dependencies (kernels, disk images, dtb, boot ROM) —
# ~2.5GB (ubuntu.img alone is ~2.2GB). Must NOT be committed. These are
# the FS-mode deps used by Phase 3 (TLB/system-register FI); users fetch
# them separately. The vendored gem5-fs source tree is now pulled in as
# a git submodule at ./gem5-fs/ (tracking main). The large binary deps
# were relocated to .gem5-fs-backup/ and remain untracked.
.gem5-fs-backup/

# logs
*.log

.DS_Store
.claude/

# campaign per-rep temp manifests/outdirs (large, regenerable; provenance
# snapshots live in artifacts/). Keep artifacts/ tracked as verification evidence.
runs/
__pycache__/

# R4-8 carrier ELF：ssit_dual_set / a06_size_be 的在库策略是
# **只提交 .c 源码，编译产物由集成侧构建**（钉在
# tests/test_lsu_hook_s10_platformfix.py 的"编译产物不进仓库"断言里；commit
# 8276087b / 5082dd8f 均只提交源码）。但工具链要求在磁盘上存在该 ELF
# （lsu_campaign.wl_binary_path 直接指向本路径），因此"忽略"而不是"清理"。
# 其余 workloads/directed/* 同级二进制仍照旧跟踪——此处是这两个 carrier 的
# 专项规则，不是全仓惯例的变更。
workloads/directed/ssit_dual_set
workloads/directed/a06_size_be
